# PostureSec – Local Setup Documentation

## Overview
This repository documents the complete process of running the **PostureSec** application locally using Docker Compose.  

The goal was to successfully bring up the full stack (Frontend, Backend, and PostgreSQL Database) and verify that the application is accessible via the browser.

---

## Prerequisites
- Docker Desktop installed and running
- Git installed
- Stable internet connection
- Terminal (Git Bash / PowerShell / VS Code Terminal)

